    "body": "Require Transformers 5.20.1 and refresh its lock entry so Bridge installations include native Beam configuration and modeling support. Retain the existing `<5.21` upper bound; no other locked package version changes.\n\nThis is the dependency prerequisite for removing the local Beam configuration fallback in #6528. The recipe PR carries the same dependency update so its tests can install native Beam while this PR is pending.\n\nValidation: tested together with the native Beam cleanup in #6528 using NeMo 26.10 RC5 with only Transformers upgraded to 5.20.1. The focused Beam, H200/GB200 recipe, AutoBridge, model bridge, conversion utility and HF wrapper suites passed: 631 passed, 27 CUDA-only skips. Native Beam config roundtrips and tiny HF model construction/forward passed. Generated-document consistency and all-files pre-commit hooks passed. `uv lock --check --offline` also passed with uv 0.9.9 and the CI-pinned uv 0.7.2. This does not claim new GPU performance measurements.\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
    "closed_at": "2026-10-18T06:14:29Z",
